WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.419
Use comparative forms to compare two things and superlatives to compare three or

00:00:04.419 --> 00:00:04.744
more.

00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:08.497
Choose the comparative of tall. Answer: taller

00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:13.137
Compare two trees and then describe the tallest of three trees.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.361
Discuss why: Taller compares two things.
